{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-pyramid-infra","title":"基础设施测试金字塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/testing-pyramid-infra","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础设施测试金字塔\">基础设施测试金字塔</h1><p>软件测试金字塔由 Mike Cohn 在 2009 年提出，其核心洞察是：测试越靠近底部执行越快、成本越低、反馈越及时。将这一模型映射到基础设施领域，需要重新定义每一层的含义——因为基础设施代码的&quot;单元&quot;不是一个函数，而是一个资源声明或模块；其&quot;集成&quot;不是两个类的协作，而是安全组与子网路由的组合效果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>测试金字塔</strong>：底宽顶窄的分层模型，低层测试数量多且快，高层测试数量少但置信度高</li>\n<li><strong>静态分析</strong>：不部署资源、纯代码检查的最底层验证</li>\n<li><strong>单元测试</strong>：隔离验证单个模块的输入/输出逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>集成测试</strong>：创建真实资源验证模块间交互</li>\n<li><strong>端到端测试</strong>：部署完整环境验证业务场景的顶层验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"金字塔的四个层级\">金字塔的四个层级</h2><p>基础设施测试金字塔在经典三层模型基础上增加了静态分析作为最底层，形成四层结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>验证对象</th>\n<th>执行时间</th>\n<th>云资源消耗</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>语法、格式、已知反模式</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>tflint</code>、<code>checkov</code>、<code>tofu validate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>单个模块的输出与行为</td>\n<td>秒~分钟</td>\n<td>无（mock）或极少</td>\n<td><code>tofu test</code>（mock provider）、Pulumi unit test</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>模块间交互、真实资源创建</td>\n<td>分钟~十分钟</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>Terratest、<code>tofu test</code>（apply）、Pulumi integration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端测试</td>\n<td>完整环境的功能与安全</td>\n<td>十分钟~小时</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Terratest + HTTP/SSH 验证、InSpec</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每上升一层，测试的<strong>置信度</strong>上升，但<strong>执行成本</strong>（时间、金钱、维护）也随之攀升。金字塔的核心指导原则是：尽可能把验证逻辑下沉到低层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静态分析层-零成本的第一道防线\">静态分析层：零成本的第一道防线</h2><p>静态分析不部署任何资源，纯粹对代码文本进行分析。它能在开发者提交代码的瞬间提供反馈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"# tflint 能捕获 terraform validate 漏掉的错误&#10;# 例如：无效的 EC2 实例类型&#10;resource &quot;aws_instance&quot; &quot;web&quot; {&#10;  ami           = &quot;ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0&quot;&#10;  instance_type = &quot;t2.invalid&quot;  # tflint: ERROR&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># tflint 能捕获 terraform validate 漏掉的错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 例如：无效的 EC2 实例类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"aws_instance\" \"web\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ami           = \"ami-0c55b159cbfafe1f0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  instance_type = \"t2.invalid\"  # tflint: ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>静态分析工具的分类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>语法验证</strong>：<code>terraform validate</code> / <code>tofu validate</code>——检查 HCL 语法和 provider schema 匹配</li>\n<li><strong>Lint 规则</strong>：<code>tflint</code>——检查 provider 特定的错误（无效 AMI、不存在的实例类型、废弃参数）</li>\n<li><strong>安全扫描</strong>：Checkov、tfsec——检查已知的安全反模式（公开的 S3 桶、未加密的 RDS）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[开发者编写 IaC] --&gt; B[静态分析]&#10;    B --&gt; C{通过?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[单元测试]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[即时反馈修复]&#10;    D --&gt; F{通过?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[集成测试]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[修复模块逻辑]&#10;    G --&gt; I{通过?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[端到端测试]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[修复交互问题]&#10;    J --&gt; L[部署]\">graph TB\n    A[开发者编写 IaC] --&gt; B[静态分析]\n    B --&gt; C{通过?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[单元测试]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[即时反馈修复]\n    D --&gt; F{通过?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[集成测试]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[修复模块逻辑]\n    G --&gt; I{通过?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[端到端测试]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[修复交互问题]\n    J --&gt; L[部署]</pre><h2 id=\"单元测试层-隔离验证模块逻辑\">单元测试层：隔离验证模块逻辑</h2><p>基础设施的&quot;单元&quot;是一个 Terraform/OpenTofu 模块或 Pulumi 组件。单元测试的目标是验证模块在给定输入下是否产生正确的输出和资源属性——<strong>不需要实际创建云资源</strong>。</p>\n<p>OpenTofu 1.8+ 引入的 mock provider 使真正的零成本单元测试成为可能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"# tests/vpc_unit.tftest.hcl&#10;mock_provider &quot;aws&quot; {&#10;  mock_resource &quot;aws_vpc&quot; {&#10;    defaults = {&#10;      id         = &quot;vpc-mock001&quot;&#10;      cidr_block = &quot;10.0.0.0/16&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;variables {&#10;  vpc_cidr = &quot;10.0.0.0/16&quot;&#10;  environment = &quot;test&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;run &quot;vpc_cidr_matches_input&quot; {&#10;  command = plan&#10;  assert {&#10;    condition     = aws_vpc.main.cidr_block == var.vpc_cidr&#10;    error_message = &quot;VPC CIDR 应与输入变量匹配&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># tests/vpc_unit.tftest.hcl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mock_provider \"aws\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mock_resource \"aws_vpc\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaults = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      id         = \"vpc-mock001\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>variables {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  vpc_cidr = \"10.0.0.0/16\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  environment = \"test\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run \"vpc_cidr_matches_input\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  command = plan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    condition     = aws_vpc.main.cidr_block == var.vpc_cidr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error_message = \"VPC CIDR 应与输入变量匹配\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>单元测试的关键约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不依赖云凭证</strong>——通过 mock 或 plan-only 模式运行</li>\n<li><strong>执行时间 &lt; 30 秒</strong>——保证开发者愿意频繁运行</li>\n<li><strong>验证逻辑而非基础设施</strong>——条件分支、<code>for_each</code> 展开、输出计算</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"集成测试层-验证组合行为\">集成测试层：验证组合行为</h2><p>当模块通过单元测试后，需要验证模块之间的<em>组合</em>是否产生预期效果。集成测试会创建真实的云资源，但范围限定在一组紧密耦合的资源上：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{integration} = C_{resource} \\times N_{resources} \\times T_{duration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{resource}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单个资源的每小时成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{resources}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eso</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ces</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是测试涉及的资源数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{duration}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是测试执行时长（含创建和销毁）。</p>\n<p>集成测试的典型模式是 <strong>deploy → validate → destroy</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用 <code>terraform apply</code> 创建资源</li>\n<li>通过 API 调用、HTTP 请求或 SSH 连接验证资源状态</li>\n<li>用 <code>terraform destroy</code> 清理资源</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"端到端测试层-全环境验证\">端到端测试层：全环境验证</h2><p>金字塔顶端的端到端测试部署一个完整的环境副本（网络、计算、存储、安全策略），然后运行功能性和非功能性验证。这是成本最高的测试类型，但也是唯一能捕获跨栈交互问题的验证手段。</p>\n<p>端到端测试的典型验证点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从外部网络能否访问负载均衡器的 HTTPS 端点</li>\n<li>数据库实例是否只接受来自应用子网的连接</li>\n<li>DNS 记录是否正确解析到目标 IP</li>\n<li>自动伸缩组在负载下是否按预期扩展</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"金字塔的反模式\">金字塔的反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>倒金字塔</td>\n<td>所有测试都是端到端</td>\n<td>执行慢、成本高、反馈滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰淇淋筒</td>\n<td>大量手动验证 + 少量自动化</td>\n<td>不可重复、人为错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙漏型</td>\n<td>只有静态分析和端到端，缺少中间层</td>\n<td>定位问题困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯静态</td>\n<td>只跑 lint 就自称&quot;已测试&quot;</td>\n<td>逻辑错误完全逃逸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>健康的金字塔比例参考：静态分析覆盖 100% 的代码路径，单元测试覆盖每个模块的核心逻辑分支，集成测试覆盖关键模块组合，端到端测试覆盖每个环境的 smoke 路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试层级选择的决策框架\">测试层级选择的决策框架</h2><p>面对一个具体的验证需求，用以下判据决定放在哪一层：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>能否通过静态分析捕获？</strong>（如：是否使用了被禁止的资源类型）→ 放最底层</li>\n<li><strong>能否不创建资源就验证？</strong>（如：模块输出值的计算逻辑）→ 单元测试</li>\n<li><strong>需要验证资源间的交互吗？</strong>（如：安全组是否允许来自特定子网的流量）→ 集成测试</li>\n<li><strong>需要完整环境才能复现？</strong>（如：跨 VPC peering 的 DNS 解析）→ 端到端</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种分层决策不是一次性的——随着工具能力的增强（如 mock provider 的完善），原先必须在集成层验证的逻辑可以下沉到单元层，从而降低总体执行成本。</p>\n<p>更多关于如何将测试金字塔落地为具体工作流，参见 <a href=\"test-driven-infrastructure\">测试驱动的基础设施</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础设施测试金字塔将验证工作分为四层——静态分析、单元测试、集成测试、端到端测试——每层在成本与置信度之间取得不同的平衡。核心原则是尽可能将验证逻辑下沉到低层以获得快速反馈和低成本，仅在必要时才使用高层测试来覆盖组合行为和真实环境效果。避免倒金字塔和纯静态两种反模式，建立覆盖率与执行效率并重的分层策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础设施测试金字塔","id":"基础设施测试金字塔"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"金字塔的四个层级","id":"金字塔的四个层级"},{"level":2,"text":"静态分析层：零成本的第一道防线","id":"静态分析层-零成本的第一道防线"},{"level":2,"text":"单元测试层：隔离验证模块逻辑","id":"单元测试层-隔离验证模块逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"集成测试层：验证组合行为","id":"集成测试层-验证组合行为"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端测试层：全环境验证","id":"端到端测试层-全环境验证"},{"level":2,"text":"金字塔的反模式","id":"金字塔的反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"测试层级选择的决策框架","id":"测试层级选择的决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"测试驱动的基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/infrastructure-testing/foundations/test-driven-infrastructure"}}